      "role": "user",
      "content": "We have paired proteome (250 proteins) and phosphoproteome (150 sites) tables from 46 kidney tumours and want a partial-correlation network linking the two layers. The aims page says one network for the whole cohort, the grant narrative says one per tumour, and I can't tell which my PI meant."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Do you want one network per tumour?\n  You wrote: \"The aims page says one network for the whole cohort, the grant narrative says one per tumour, and I can't tell which my PI meant\". LIONESS-DRAGON's contract: \"LIONESS-DRAGON estimates DRAGON's two shrinkage values once on all samples, then derives each sample's network from the all-sample network and the network refitted without that sample\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    },
